Hi! Thanks all to those who participated! We have consensus to land =
these two PRs; #1343 got tweaked during this call.

ekr - merge when you get a chance.

spt

> On Jun 12, 2024, at 16:23, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>=20
> Hi! Just reminder to get any concerns about merging these in by 17 =
June 2024.
>=20
> spt
>=20
>> On Jun 3, 2024, at 11:38, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>>=20
>> Since draft-ietf-tls-rfc8446bis last completed WGLC, two PRs have =
been submitted (and discussed) that include changes to normative =
language:
>>=20
>> - #1343: Forbid the sender from sending redundant update_requested =
KeyUpdates
>> https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1343
>>=20
>> - #1345: Forbid the sender from sending duplicate supported groups =
entries
>> https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1354
>>=20
>> The discussion so far seems to support consensus to merge these PRs. =
If you object, please
>> do so on the issue or in response to this message.  Absent any =
pushback, we will direct the
>> editors to incorporate them in two weeks' time.
>>=20
>> Cheers,
>> spt
>=20

